---
---

<section class="relative min-h-[92vh] pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28 flex flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Volumetric ambient light -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 right-0 w-[500px] lg:w-[800px] h-[500px] lg:h-[800px] volumetric-orange opacity-40 pointer-events-none -z-10 translate-x-1/3"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] lg:w-[600px] h-[400px] lg:h-[600px] volumetric-blue opacity-30 pointer-events-none -z-10 -translate-x-1/4"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 w-full">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Copy & Value Proposition -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col">
        
        <!-- Status indicator badge -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 w-fit mb-6">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#F26101] animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="font-code text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D9E8F5] uppercase font-semibold">
            Pionero en Integración de IA & Productividad &bull; Paraguay
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Master Title -->
        <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5.2rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-tight text-white mb-6">
          Libera tu <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="italic text-[#F26101]">potencial.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white/90 font-light mb-6 tracking-wide leading-snug">
          Experto en Negocios, Productividad de Élite e Inteligencia Artificial Estratégica.
        </p>

        <!-- Descriptive Body text -->
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#D6D6DC] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-8 font-light">
          <p>
            Con más de 9 años transformando empresas y profesionales, Michael Sahlmann se ha consolidado como un referente en la optimización de procesos, desarrollo humano y despliegue tecnológico.
          </p>
          <p class="text-white/80 border-l-2 border-[#F26101] pl-4 italic">
            ¿El objetivo? Una metodología implacable para alcanzar <strong>MÁS con MENOS esfuerzo</strong>, liberando a líderes y equipos de la fricción operativa para construir una <strong>VIDA LEGENDARIA</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Action CTAs -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-4 mb-12">
          <a
            href="#contacto"
            class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-xs font-black tracking-[0.18em] uppercase bg-white text-black hover:bg-[#F26101] hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#F26101]/30 group"
          >
            <span class="relative z-10 flex items-center gap-2">
              Agendar Sesión Estratégica
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="#calculadora"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-4 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase bg-transparent text-white border border-white/20 hover:border-[#F26101] hover:text-[#F26101] hover:bg-white/5 transition-all duration-300"
          >
            Calcular Retorno de IA
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Trust tags -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 text-xs text-white/50 font-code">
          <span>&bull; Metodología Linchpin</span>
          <span>&bull; Automatización N8N</span>
          <span>&bull; Agentes Autónomos</span>
          <span>&bull; Deep Work & Foco</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Profile Hero Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-md">
          
          <!-- Outer decorative halo -->
          <div class="absolute -inset-1.5 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F26101]/30 via-white/10 to-transparent blur-xl opacity-75"></div>

          <!-- Card Container -->
          <div class="relative bg-[#0A0D14] border border-white/15 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-5 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl overflow-hidden">
            
            <!-- Photo container with inner glow -->
            <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[4/4.6] bg-[#050505]">
              <img
                src="/images/michael-sahlmann.webp"
                alt="Michael Sahlmann - Conferencista y Consultor en IA"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top filter contrast-[1.05] brightness-95 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
                width="800"
                height="920"
                loading="eager"
                decoding="async"
              />

              <!-- Gradient overlay at bottom of photo -->
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0A0D14] via-transparent to-transparent opacity-80"></div>

              <!-- Top right badge -->
              <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-[#050505]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/15 rounded-full px-3 py-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-code text-[9px] text-white">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
                <span>VERIFICADO</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Caption on bottom of photo -->
              <div class="absolute bottom-4 inset-x-4">
                <span class="font-code text-[10px] text-[#F26101] tracking-widest uppercase block mb-1 font-bold">
                  Mentor & Conferencista Internacional
                </span>
                <p class="font-display text-lg text-white font-normal leading-snug">
                  "Paraguay puede estar atrasado. Vos no."
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Lower Card Info -->
            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between font-code text-xs text-white/70">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#F26101] font-bold">+493</span>
                <span>Líderes formados</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#F26101] font-bold">9+</span>
                <span>Años en el campo</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Live KPI Proof Bar -->
    <div class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-white/10 grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      
      <div class="bg-[#0A0D14]/60 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <span class="font-code text-[10px] text-[#F26101] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase block mb-2 font-bold">Trayectoria</span>
        <div class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white font-light tracking-tight mb-1">+9 Años</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#D6D6DC]/70 font-light">Optimizando procesos de negocio y escalabilidad empresarial.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#0A0D14]/60 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <span class="font-code text-[10px] text-[#F26101] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase block mb-2 font-bold">Comunidad</span>
        <div class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white font-light tracking-tight mb-1">+493</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#D6D6DC]/70 font-light">Alumnos y directivos transformados en sus operaciones.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#0A0D14]/60 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <span class="font-code text-[10px] text-[#F26101] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase block mb-2 font-bold">Eficiencia</span>
        <div class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white font-light tracking-tight mb-1">50%</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#D6D6DC]/70 font-light">Reducción típica de horas perdidas en tareas manuales.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#0A0D14]/60 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <span class="font-code text-[10px] text-[#F26101] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase block mb-2 font-bold">Propósito</span>
        <div class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white font-light tracking-tight mb-1">Vida Legendaria</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#D6D6DC]/70 font-light">Rentabilidad sin sacrificar tu libertad personal ni tu salud.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
